{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51552","headline":"水（《文苑英华》又有《柳》、《松》二首，《全唐诗》均作韩溉，应别出互见。） · 韩喜","name":"水（《文苑英华》又有《柳》、《松》二首，《全唐诗》均作韩溉，应别出互见。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方圆不定性空求（柔），东注沧溟早晚休。\n高截碧塘长耿耿，远飞青嶂更悠悠。\n潇湘月浸千年色，梦泽烟含万古愁。\n别有岭头鸣咽处，爲君分（更）作断肠流。\n（《文苑英华》一六三《地部》。\n又《诗话总龟》二一《咏物门》引《续末流事诗》）（〖1〗《全唐诗》卷六七一唐彦谦有《逢韩喜》诗，知韩喜爲唐末人。\n原列入「无世次」作者，今移此。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩喜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}